      "statement": "models.Execution tracks a status lifecycle (pending/running/succeeded/failed/timed_out from openapi.ExecutionStatus) and an independent approval_state (not_required/pending/approved/rejected from openapi.ApprovalState); ExecutionFromRequest always creates new executions with status pending and approval_state not_required.",
